---
description: Storybook lives in the design repo
alwaysApply: false
---

Storybook documents `@eden-ecommerce/design` only. Host + stories live in **eden-ecommerce/design** at `apps/storybook`.

Run stories from that repo (`pnpm dev`). Do not add a `stories/` tree here.

## Colocated stories (design package)

- `{Name}.stories.tsx` lives **in** `{Name}/` beside `{Name}.tsx`.
- Every `'use client'` component has `{Name}.loading.tsx` / `{Name}.error.tsx`. Stories may include Loading/Error.
- RSC must not have loading/error files.

## No loaders in Storybook

Never import `@eden-ecommerce/lib`. Mock `imageSlot` / `media` with static placeholder markup.
